#> midwut:help/check/vehicle

# §6 En
## §e Input Data:
### The entity is the executor of the command for which you need to check the availability of vehicle
## §e Output Data:
### The function returns 1 (true) if the entity has a vehicle, otherwise 0 (false)

# §6 Ru
